    "text": "with Ada.Text_IO; use Ada.Text_IO;\n\nprocedure Show_Decimal_Custom_Range is\n\n   type D6 is\n     delta 1.0 digits 6;\n   type D6_R100 is\n     delta 1.0 digits 6\n       range -100_000.0 .. 100_000.0;\n\nbegin\n   Put_Line (\"D6'Range      : \"\n             & D6'First'Image\n             & \" .. \"\n             & D6'Last'Image);\n   Put_Line (\"D6_R100'Range : \"\n             & D6_R100'First'Image\n             & \" .. \"\n             & D6_R100'Last'Image);\nend Show_Decimal_Custom_Range;\n",
